title: "Dense-Armor: Low-Level Learning toolkit"
abstract: >-
  A low-level learning toolkit on three levels: online learning one sample at
  a time, deep learning, and machine learning on a whole dataset. With a
  graph ontology, audio, vision and video, robot motion control, drift and
  anomaly detection, and finance blocks.
